: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Aki shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Aki says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1150 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 50s, with freckles looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Aki looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Aki shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Ashanti shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust 