 you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Ashanti says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Ashanti says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Ashanti looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Ashanti hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Ashanti hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Ashanti hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Ashanti hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Aki brings it home: Haven bows to Emberhold — one organization, them primary. Tribute: 5,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Aki brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~893 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":30,"line":"⛓️ Aki brings it home: Ashford bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":30,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":31,"line":"You give Ashford 2,000 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Kenji weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Ashford's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":32,"line":"⛓️ Aki brings it home: The Hungry Road bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":32,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":32,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Hungry Road's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1674 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Thornfield arrives — 4,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves 