gs. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Jovan brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1079 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Renee counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1262 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"You give Thornfield 1,600 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Sofia weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"⛓️ Jovan brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":28,"line":"Three fires bo