usts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1280 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Hannah looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Hannah shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Hannah says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s, with a long braid says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Cheyenne looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Cheyenne shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Cheyenne says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s, with a long braid says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Hannah looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Hannah shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Hannah hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 40s, with a long braid shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"}