ut the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Jasper shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Jasper counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":16,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Jasper says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":18,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":19,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the north. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+585 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":20,"line":"Donated Burdock (+2520 kcal). Trust +7. They'll remember this."},{"day":20,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Cheyenne hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":21,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Jasper says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Jasper shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Jasper shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":22,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":23,"line":"At the grave, Arnold, Liam speak for Hannah — \"Elena trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":23,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Jasper says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Jasper looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Liam brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":26,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Jasper says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":26,"line":"You accept Emberhold's food — 2,383 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Kira clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Liam brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Liam brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"You give Stonebridge 1,750 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Kenji weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":30,"line":"