 -10.)"},{"day":62,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,552 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":62,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,514 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":62,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,608 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,677 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,599 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":63,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":65,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 3,000 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":70,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":71,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":72,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":74,"line":"At the grave, Heinrich, Gloria, Anwesha and 3 more speak for Abigail — \"Autumn trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":76,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":77,"line":"🍲 The shared granary opens: 5,000 kcal for every fire of the realm, no strings. Emberhold, Stonebridge, Thornfield count it — and remember who fed them first. (Trust +10 with each — 3 grieving fire(s); theirs waits.)"},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute from Emberhold arrives — 2,813 kcal of grain into the pantry. Their fields, our fire."},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":77,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":80,"line":"Donated Purslane (+300 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":81,"line":"Donated Burdock (+720 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":81,"line":"Donated Purslane (+720 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":81,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":82,"line":"At the grave, Gloria, Anwesha, Tariq and 2 more speak for Heinrich — \"Abigail trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":83,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":83,"line":"At the grave, Anwesha, Tariq, Tom and 1 more speak for Gloria — \"Heinrich trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":83,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,568 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Zoe clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":85,"line":"Donated Burdock (+1800 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":85,"line":"Donated Purslane (+840 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":86,"line":"At the grave, Tariq, Tom, Nora and 1 more speak for Anwesha — \"Gloria trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":86,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":87,"line":"At the grave, Tom, Nora, Farid speak for Tariq — \"Anwesha trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":87,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":88,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":90,"line":"◈ Tariq Mahmood walks out of the light alone, which is how he walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it.