y should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Pasquale says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Pasquale looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1012 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Pasquale shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 50s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the south ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 50s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1265 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1284 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Eli hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Eli hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Eli hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1494 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Pasquale says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Bertin hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1003 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":14,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Pasquale counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"3 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1125 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Pasquale hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Pasquale hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Fatima saw how close you've gotten to Eli. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1055 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Pasquale hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +1189 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~856 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Pasquale hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Pasquale hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Eli brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Eli brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Fatima saw how close you've gotten to Eli. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":27,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Fatima weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1139 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":28,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,155 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Marcus clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1212 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Mara saw how close you've gotten to Sari. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"At the grave, Pasquale, Jack, Bertin and 2 more speak for Eli — \"Renee trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":32,"line":"⛓️ Eli brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":32,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":32,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":33,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":35,"line":"Eli saw how close you've gotten to Fatima. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":35,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,547 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Marcus clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":37,"line":"Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. Emberhold's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.)"},{"day":37,"line":"Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. Thornfield's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":44,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":44,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,537 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Marcus clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":44,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~929 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾