ent (Level 1). Trust builds 2x faster. You're TOO good though — once per week you can start a diplomatic incident: villagers argue, you pick the winner (+trust with them, -trust with the loser)."},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Andres says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Andres says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Andres says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Andres shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Andres looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1149 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Minh looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Andres looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Andres looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1158 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Andres looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Andres shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day